      "writtenOn": "2022-08-18T16:32:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: I find the structure of this test odd and a little hard to read. I think it would be more readable, albeit more verbose, for each scenario to be its own test. Maybe we need something like `TEST_P` in ztest. Since we don\u0027t have that now, this is a nit. See go/parameterized-testing#loops.",
      "revId": "de8418df73cb3f27fc7f62034483f46a17508e38",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
