      "writtenOn": "2022-08-19T10:30:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No joke, it\u0027s a nightmare! clang-format is giving me a hard time here, how about this? One parameter per line, could even add the field name, like\n\n```\n                {\n                        cmd: EC_REBOOT_CANCEL,\n                        flags: 0,\n                        expect_return: EC_RES_SUCCESS,\n                        expect_reboot_at_shutdown: EC_REBOOT_CANCEL,\n                        expect_reset_called: 0,\n                        expect_reset_flags: 0,\n                        expect_hibernate_called: 0,\n                },\n```\n\nWhat do you think?\n\nWe could definitely use some parameterized helper!",
      "parentUuid": "170f7530_ae401949",
      "revId": "de8418df73cb3f27fc7f62034483f46a17508e38",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
